## Development

```sh
npm ci --legacy-peer-deps
npm run check
```

`npm run check` runs source types, unit tests, a clean build, package checks,
consumer declaration checks, server rendering, and bundle budgets. Storybook is
available with `npm run storybook`; browser verification is optional.

